<title>BELARUS: Belarus oil output eases to 0.90 mln tns H1.</title>
<headline>Belarus oil output eases to 0.90 mln tns H1.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus crude output was slightly down at 0.903 million tonnes in the first half of the year from 0.928 million tonnes in the same 1996 period, the statistics ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ministry also said the former Soviet republic refined 5.80 million tonnes from 7.30 million tonnes in the same periods.</p>
<p>BELARUS OIL OUTPUT</p>
<p>			     Jan-Jun 97    Jan-May 97    Jan-Jun 96</p>
<p>    (tonnes)	     903,269	 752,405	 928,484</p>
<p>VOLUME OF CRUDE REFINED IN BELARUS</p>
<p>    (tonnes)	     5,796,171     4,847,051     7,297,505</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Minsk newsroom +375 017 227 3594</p>
</text>
